sequenceDiagram
    participant DB
    participant UDFRunner

    Note over DB,UDFRunner: Run call opened by DB with flow-controlled bidirectional data exchange

    DB->>UDFRunner: CallOpen(Run, call_metadata) + DataMetaData + first input RecordBatch
    UDFRunner-->>DB: Next(byte_budget, reset=false, row_id=n)
    DB-->>UDFRunner: RecordBatch(input rows starting at n)
    UDFRunner-->>DB: DataMetaData + first output RecordBatch with row ids for scalar correlation
    DB->>UDFRunner: Next(byte_budget, reset=false, row_id=m)
    UDFRunner-->>DB: RecordBatch(output rows starting at m)
    DB->>UDFRunner: CallClose(Run)
